      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Build 801, patch notes mentioned ongoing improvements for Networked IK. No such thing here, this was recorded last night https://i.gyazo.com/ec7148275ce0450985efa5426b5e1092.mp4\n\nJust... How will they ever make Networked IK look as smooth as local IK? I'm really sad as it has taken a ton of immersion away. I remember when I was accurately able to read my friend's gestures and hand motions. Those days are long gone.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
