      "value": "This just makes me sad. Look at how fluid the movement of all these shibas was before Networked IK. The feeling of real people being behind the avatars, the feeling of presence, was so much more powerful: \n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q9OuaIKGdow",
